('https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/42658875/','Ahsan et al. Assessment of disability of leprosy in Bangladesh','2026-08-27','PUBMED_INDEXED_PRIMARY_RECORD_DIRECT_OPEN_FAILED','Facility-based 176 people studied, high disability burden, no separate cured-without-visible-impairment effect','Q04 insufficient to isolate disease history independently of physical disability','Correction 2026-10-16 changes study sites; do not derive fiction as recorded incident'),
