('https://link.springer.com/article/10.1186/s13023-020-1323-y','Hossain et al. Thalassemia attitudes among Bangladesh college students, Orphanet','2020-02-21','PUBLISHER_FULL_TEXT','1578 Jamalpur students; of 521 familiar, about 40% unsure or unwilling to befriend a patient','Q06 direct friendship attitude, not actual club gatekeeping','Do not treat hereditary thalassemia as contagious'),
('https://link.springer.com/article/10.1186/s13023-021-01947-6','Hossain et al. Parental perspective of thalassemia in Bangladesh, Orphanet','2021-07-16','PUBLISHER_FULL_TEXT','Bangladesh parents reported psychosocial burden, care barriers and perception about thalassemia','Q06 secondary contextual support for family/care burden, not specific student club inclusion','No direct observed student discrimination under identical conditions'),
('https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC2996185/','Sarker et al. Arsenicosis perception/social implications Bangladesh','2010','PMC_RECAPTCHA_OFFICIAL_INDEXED_FULL_TEXT','150 arsenicosis respondents; 32% perceived neighbors disliked participation in social activities','Q07 partial for diagnosis-only exclusion; visible skin findings confound','Perceived dislike, not observed uniformly nondisabled applicant rejection'),
