('https://academicjournals.org/journal/JPHE/article-full-text/72D4F6761807','Sultana. Awareness and psychosocial support breast cancer Dhaka 240 patients','2019-09-30','PUBLISHER_FULL_TEXT','240 women 2014-2017 CMH Dhaka; 75% reported community negligence, plus family difficulties','Q09 partial since active patients not verified completed-treatment survivors','Do not generalize to all women; body-image/physical health confounds'),
